@startuml

' == THEME (component) ==

' Shared brand palette (same values as the class diagrams)
!define C_YELLOW FEFECE
!define C_RED    FDEDEC
!define C_PURPLE F4ECF7
!define C_BLUE   EBF5FB
!define C_GREEN  E9F7EF
!define C_GREY   EAECEE

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

' Fine, neutral connectors (no thick line, no vivid color)

skinparam component {
    ' default fill
    BackgroundColor #C_BLUE
    ' Contrast handled by background only:
    BackgroundColor<<yellow>>   #C_YELLOW
    BackgroundColor<<green>>  #C_GREEN
    BackgroundColor<<red>>    #C_RED
    BackgroundColor<<purple>> #C_PURPLE
    BackgroundColor<<grey>>   #C_GREY
}
' Keep only the color, not the «stereotype» label:
hide <<yellow>> stereotype
hide <<green>> stereotype
hide <<red>> stereotype
hide <<purple>> stereotype
hide <<grey>> stereotype

' == CONTENT ==

component "Terminal Application" as App
component "Terminal Calypso Card API\n[CNA-TCC-API]" as TCC
component "Terminal Calypso Crypto\nSymmetric API [CNA-TCCS-API]" as TCCS
component "Terminal Calypso Crypto\nLegacy SAM API (this specification)" as TCCL <<yellow>>
component "Legacy SAM\n(SAM C1, HSM C1, S1E1, S1Dx)" as SAM

App  --> TCCL : uses
App  --> TCC  : uses
TCC  --> TCCS  : delegates crypto operations
TCCL ..> TCCS : implements (factory)
TCCL --> SAM  : drives
@enduml
